                            <button class="absolute top-3 right-3 z-10 w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-sm flex items-center justify-center text-[#5a413f] hover:text-[#EF5350] shadow-sm transition-all">
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">favorite</span>
                            </button>
                            <img alt="Eevee" class="w-full h-full object-contain mix-blend-multiply group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/AP1WRLsxyaao2f20dluqUB3V_SA8OtAayXj5VVAcvXtOTQcwl462bs4UsOzsIBk5NI9ofJIZZ2lsH_dphsPKg11Z7bY8dbtdx9HPWrPi93B7alA5lSl80yEXSGN49jaViMDmPgqU9wbeFo7uE_rZUGYIxCriLIpo3I210GVYUdU9Qga1lj6mssh8QG1ssqJLADBEzDBkiLxl2_nlzABbwLqOKb7hPwYOiroljRakYqPrQXVD7_-UhUyn96Byklcp">
                        </div>
                        <div class="p-4 md:p-5 flex flex-col flex-1">
                            <div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#5a413f] mb-1 uppercase">文具 / Pokopia</div>
                            <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#0d1e25] mb-2 line-clamp-2 min-h-[56px]">伊布與好朋友 文具禮盒組 (附筆袋)</h4>
